1
00:01:37,600 --> 00:01:38,880
Hello, Shiya.

2
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:39,880
How are you doing?

3
00:01:40,560 --> 00:01:41,440
Stop it, Jingyan.

4
00:01:41,440 --> 00:01:42,440
He's really busy.

5
00:01:43,280 --> 00:01:43,840
Pei Song,

6
00:01:44,400 --> 00:01:46,520
you're not coming to the last trip before the divorce?

7
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,580
Are you even human?

8
00:01:48,840 --> 00:01:50,880
Shiya just wants to have something to remember it by.

9
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:52,140
Is it that hard for you?

10
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:54,800
Trip? What trip?

11
00:01:55,520 --> 00:01:56,080
Bro,

12
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,320
are you pretending to have amnesia?

13
00:02:12,320 --> 00:02:12,850
Pei Song.

14
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:15,360
Are you going on the trip tomorrow?

15
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:17,520
I want to have a memory before the divorce,

16
00:02:17,520 --> 00:02:20,079
to make up for not having a honeymoon.

17
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:21,880
I don't think so.

18
00:02:21,880 --> 00:02:23,280
R&D is quite busy lately,

19
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:24,570
so I don't have time.

20
00:02:27,640 --> 00:02:28,120
Okay.

21
00:02:35,880 --> 00:02:36,520
Pei Song.

22
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,600
I'll go.

23
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,130
Send me the address.

24
00:02:42,680 --> 00:02:43,640
I mean I'll be right there.

25
00:02:43,640 --> 00:02:44,770
Send me the address.

26
00:02:46,040 --> 00:02:46,600
Fine.

27
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,360
You know what's good for you.

28
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,079
I'll WeChat you. Hurry up.

29
00:02:56,079 --> 00:02:57,840
Shiya, baby.

30
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:12,920
I'm exhausted.

31
00:03:12,920 --> 00:03:13,760
I'm not doing it anymore.

32
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,090
I'm going to take a rest.

33
00:03:27,280 --> 00:03:27,960
Pei Song.

34
00:03:36,920 --> 00:03:37,400
Sorry.

35
00:03:37,560 --> 00:03:38,320
I'm late.

36
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:40,490
Pei Ning,

37
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:41,329
do me a favor.

38
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:48,480
They happen to be free,

39
00:03:48,480 --> 00:03:49,740
so I asked them to come.

40
00:03:50,840 --> 00:03:51,760
You don't mind, do you?

41
00:03:51,760 --> 00:03:52,360
Of course,

42
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:56,240
I mean of course not.

43
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,960
That's great.

44
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:01,320
Then it's settled.

45
00:04:01,320 --> 00:04:02,800
Let you two gentlemen

46
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,400
set up the tent together.

47
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:05,880
Shiya, stop working.

48
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:06,410
Let's go.

49
00:04:08,840 --> 00:04:09,370
Brother,

50
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:11,400
drink some water.

51
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:12,720
Thanks.

52
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,330
Let's set up the tent first.

53
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,440
Make it strong.

54
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,690
Who do you think will be faster?

55
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:50,760
I think...

56
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:19,480
It's done.

57
00:05:30,240 --> 00:05:30,920
Shiya.

58
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:43,250
Jingyan,

59
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:45,170
bring your things here.

60
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:46,360
Coming.

61
00:05:53,400 --> 00:05:54,120
Sorry,

62
00:05:54,159 --> 00:05:55,080
Pei Song.

63
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:58,360
Shiya is mine tonight.

64
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:03,690
Brother.

65
00:06:15,200 --> 00:06:17,120
See, I told you there's a bar here.

66
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,240
It's pretty nice.

67
00:06:19,320 --> 00:06:20,160
Let's relax

68
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,170
and have a drink.

69
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:31,600
Shiya.

70
00:07:01,240 --> 00:07:02,840
I'll go up for some fresh air.

71
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:05,210
I'll go with you.

72
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:07,720
I want to walk alone.

73
00:07:14,280 --> 00:07:14,600
Um,

74
00:07:14,720 --> 00:07:15,250
brother,

75
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:16,820
I'm going to the restroom.

76
00:07:20,840 --> 00:07:21,480
Pei Song.

77
00:07:21,760 --> 00:07:23,600
You've been married for three years.

78
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,600
Don't tell me you don't know

79
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:25,720
that Shiya's least favorite thing

80
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,720
is anything strawberry-flavored?

81
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,760
I really didn't know.

82
00:07:31,760 --> 00:07:32,640
I thought all girls...

83
00:07:32,640 --> 00:07:33,440
Straight man.

84
00:07:36,920 --> 00:07:37,520
Jingyan.

85
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:38,880
I want to ask you,

86
00:07:39,040 --> 00:07:40,280
is there any way to keep

87
00:07:40,280 --> 00:07:42,280
Shiya and me from getting a divorce?

88
00:07:51,360 --> 00:07:52,240
It's so cold.

89
00:07:52,520 --> 00:07:55,440
I wonder if Shiya running out alone just now

90
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,680
without a coat,

91
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:59,280
is also feeling cold.

92
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,120
Thank you.

93
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:04,200
Thank you.

94
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,800
Blockhead.

95
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:30,280
Shiya.

96
00:08:32,360 --> 00:08:33,400
I actually

97
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,919
really wish

98
00:08:35,960 --> 00:08:37,280
I had met you

99
00:08:38,400 --> 00:08:39,240
first.

100
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,440
Do you remember

101
00:08:42,440 --> 00:08:43,700
when we were in college

102
00:08:44,039 --> 00:08:45,500
and met for the first time?

103
00:08:46,960 --> 00:08:48,160
It was so wonderful.

104
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:51,090
Unfortunately,

105
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,610
you disappeared later.

106
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:58,210
I couldn't find you no matter how hard I tried.

107
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:00,440
When we met again later,

108
00:09:02,440 --> 00:09:04,480
you had become my brother's wife.

109
00:09:07,680 --> 00:09:09,610
But you were just like in my memory,

110
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:10,960
so smart

111
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:11,680
and kind.

112
00:09:14,040 --> 00:09:16,360
Actually, in front of my brother,

113
00:09:17,640 --> 00:09:18,970
I, the younger brother,

114
00:09:19,800 --> 00:09:21,240
was often ignored.

115
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:23,920
Only you

116
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:27,120
would talk to me first.

117
00:09:31,360 --> 00:09:32,220
You are so good,

118
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,460
but he didn't know how to cherish you.

119
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:39,160
Even

120
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:40,920
at your father and brother's funeral,

121
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:41,920
he didn't show up.

122
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,040
He was very busy abroad at that time,

123
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,300
and really had no time.

124
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:47,240
It's not his fault.

125
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,520
How is it not his fault?

126
00:09:48,520 --> 00:09:50,120
Shiya, you are just too kind.

127
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,080
Don't worry.

128
00:09:56,360 --> 00:09:57,960
After you divorce,

129
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:01,080
I will definitely take good care of you.

130
00:10:02,280 --> 00:10:03,880
Everything will get better.

131
00:10:05,560 --> 00:10:06,440
I will send

132
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:08,840
your mother to the best sanatorium abroad.

133
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:11,200
Shiya.
